                <pb facs="0645" n="635" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv08/pg635"/>

                <head>Appendix D to HD–69</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Resolution</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">[Draft Prepared by the American Delegation]</p>
                <p>“It is agreed that the Commission on Polish Affairs should be instructed to
                    consider Articles 100 to 104 of the Treaty of Peace with Germany regarding the
                    establishment of the Free City of Dantzig, and to report at the earliest
                    possible moment as to the measures which should be taken to assure the prompt
                    execution of these clauses when the Treaty comes into force.”</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-10"><hi rendition="#small-caps">October</hi> 10,
                            1919</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
